id=adbroot
name=ADB Root Enabler (toggle)
version=1.2
versionCode=3
author=workbuddy
description=Grants adb shell (uid 2000) root via Magisk, toggleable. State file /data/adb/adbroot/state (on/off). On uninstall the policy is removed and the access setting is reset - no orphan entries left in the Magisk database.
